---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { SECTIONS } from "../data/sections";

const title = "How Much Does a Precor Treadmill Cost? (2026): Home and Gym";
const description =
  "New Precor treadmills listed at $5,885 to $16,230 at an authorized dealer on 27 Nov 2026; remanufactured ones ran $2,495 to $4,799 with a 1-year warranty.";

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      itemListElement: [
        { "@type": "ListItem", position: 1, name: "Home", item: "https://www.treadmillreviewsusa.com/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", position: 2, name: "By Price", item: "https://www.treadmillreviewsusa.com/price/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", position: 3, name: "How Much Does a Precor Treadmill Cost?", item: "https://www.treadmillreviewsusa.com/how-much-does-a-precor-treadmill-cost/" },
      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      mainEntity: [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "How much is a new Precor treadmill?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Precor publishes no prices. Top Fitness, an authorized Precor distributor, listed new Precor treadmills from $5,885 (TRM 531) to $16,230 (TRM 895 with the P94 console) on 27 November 2026. A new TRM 885 was $14,640 with the P82 console and $15,625 with the P84.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "How much is a used Precor treadmill?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "On 27 November 2026, remanufactured Precors with a one-year warranty were $2,495 (TRM 835, Build A Gym) to $4,799 (TRM 885 with P82, Fitness Superstore). Global Fitness sold used units in working order from $1,375 for a C932i to $3,575 for a TRM 885, with 30 days of parts-only cover.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "How much does a Precor TRM 885 cost?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "New, $14,640 with the P82 console or $15,625 with the P84 at Top Fitness on 27 November 2026. Rebuilt, $3,799 to $4,799 at Fitness Superstore depending on generation and console, $3,699 refurbished at Top Fitness and $3,975 refurbished at Global Fitness. Amazon showed a P80-console listing at $3,495 with no condition stated.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Does Precor make a home treadmill?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Not one you can buy new. Precor At Home listed 13 products on 27 November 2026 and no treadmill. Precor’s warranty summary still lists 200 and 400 Series home lines, but we found neither on sale. Dealers sell the commercial TRM models into homes with a separate home warranty.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Is there a Precor Black Friday sale?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Not from Precor. On 27 November 2026 Fitness Superstore offered 5% off remanufactured equipment with code BF5 until 30 November, and Build A Gym 10% off remanufactured equipment with code JACKEDFRIDAY, ending 3 December. Top Fitness showed no sale price on new Precor treadmills.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Does the Precor warranty transfer to a second owner?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "No. Precor’s warranty for commercial equipment sold into a home covers the original purchaser only and states it is not assignable and cannot be resold. A used or rebuilt Precor relies on the seller’s own warranty, typically one year of parts and labour.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Is a remanufactured Precor worth it?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Often, for heavy home use. A rebuilt TRM 885 or 781 cost about a third of the same model new on 27 November 2026, with a one-year parts and on-site labour warranty. Check the power requirement, the console generation and the delivery cost to your room first.",
          },
        },
      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      headline: title,
      description: description,
      author: { "@type": "Person", "@id": "https://www.treadmillreviewsusa.com/editorial-standards/#shaheer-ali-khan", name: "Shaheer Ali Khan", honorificSuffix: "PhD", jobTitle: "Exercise Physiology & Biomechanics Specialist", url: "https://www.treadmillreviewsusa.com/editorial-standards/#who", sameAs: ["https://www.linkedin.com/in/shaheer-ali-khan-data/"], worksFor: { "@type": "Organization", name: "Treadmill Reviews USA" } },
      datePublished: "2026-11-27",
      dateModified: "2026-11-27",
      publisher: { "@type": "Organization", name: "Treadmill Reviews USA" },
    },
  ],
};

// "More in" links: the other pages in this article's hub group.
const HERE = "/how-much-does-a-precor-treadmill-cost/";
const HUB = SECTIONS.find((s) => s.slug === "price");
const GROUP = HUB?.groups.find((g) => g.pages.some((p) => p.url === HERE)) ?? HUB?.groups[0];
const GROUP_PAGES = GROUP?.pages ?? [];
const HERE_AT = GROUP_PAGES.findIndex((p) => p.url === HERE);
// The group's first 2 pages (its leads), then the pages after this one, wrapping round, so every page in a long
// hub group gets sibling links and the leads keep theirs (PLAYBOOK §0b L1).
const MORE = [...new Set([...GROUP_PAGES.slice(0, 2), ...GROUP_PAGES.slice(HERE_AT + 1), ...GROUP_PAGES.slice(0, Math.max(HERE_AT, 0))])].filter((p) => p.url !== HERE).slice(0, 6);
---

<Layout
  title={`${title} | Treadmill Reviews USA`}
  description={description}
  ogType="article"
  article={{
    publishedTime: "2026-11-27",
    modifiedTime: "2026-11-27",
    author: "Shaheer Ali Khan",
    section: "Fitness Equipment",
    tags: [
      "how much does a precor treadmill cost",
      "precor treadmill price",
      "precor trm 885 price",
      "precor trm 835 price",
      "used precor treadmill price",
      "remanufactured precor treadmill",
    ],
  }}
  jsonLd={schema}
  stickyCta={{ text: "See Precor Prices by Model", link: "#price-table" }}
>
  <article class="ed-article" data-template="editorial">
    <div class="ed-col">
      <nav class="ed-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/price/">By Price</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
        <span>Price Guide</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="ed-title">How Much Does a Precor Treadmill Cost?</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        A new Precor treadmill cost $5,885 to $16,230 at Top Fitness, an authorized Precor distributor, on 27 November 2026, from the TRM 531 to the TRM 895. A remanufactured ex-gym Precor cost $2,495 to $4,799 with a one-year warranty at the US rebuilders we checked the same day, before Black Friday codes of 5 to 10%. Precor itself publishes no prices and sells no home treadmill. Here is every price we could read, what delivery and the 20-amp circuit add, and when rebuilt beats new.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="44" height="44" />
        <div class="ed-byline-text">
          By <a href="/editorial-standards/#who" rel="author">Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD</a><br />
          Updated November 27, 2026 · Exercise Physiology & Biomechanics Specialist · ACSM-EP, CSCS<br />
          <span class="ed-method">Based on retailer and maker listings, with prices checked on the dates shown.</span>
        </div>
        <a href="#price-table" class="btn-ghost">Prices by Model</a>
      </div>
      <p class="ed-disclosure">
        Nothing on this page is a paid placement, and it carries no affiliate links. <a href="/editorial-standards/">How we review.</a>
      </p>

      <div class="ed-body prose prose-lg">
        <p class="ed-lead">
          Precor, owned by Peloton since 2021, sells its treadmills to gyms, hotels and other facilities
          through quotes and dealers. Its own US website shows no prices, only a “Contact Sales” form, and its
          home-fitness shop sells strength equipment and a stretch trainer but no treadmill. So the price of a
          Precor depends on who is selling it: an authorized dealer selling new club machines into homes, a
          remanufacturer rebuilding ex-gym units, or a used-equipment seller. We read Precor’s site, its
          warranty documents, one authorized distributor’s full Precor catalogue, four rebuilt and used sellers
          and Amazon on 27 November 2026, which was Black Friday. Earlier prices come from our own Precor pages,
          with the dates they were seen.
        </p>

        <nav class="ed-toc not-prose" aria-label="On this page">
          <h2>On this page</h2>
          <ol>
            <li><a href="#short-answer">The Short Answer</a></li>
            <li><a href="#price-table">Precor Treadmill Prices by Model</a></li>
            <li><a href="#home-models">Is There a New Precor Home Treadmill?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#remanufactured">What a Remanufactured or Used Precor Costs</a></li>
            <li><a href="#rebuilt-vs-new">Rebuilt vs New: What You Save on the Same Model</a></li>
            <li><a href="#black-friday">Precor Black Friday Prices</a></li>
            <li><a href="#warranty">Warranty: What Precor Covers and What the Seller Covers</a></li>
            <li><a href="#delivery">Delivery, Installation and the 20-Amp Circuit</a></li>
            <li><a href="#parts-repair">Parts and Repair Costs</a></li>
            <li><a href="#vs-others">Precor vs Life Fitness, Matrix and Landice at the Same Tier</a></li>
            <li><a href="#who-should-buy">Who Should Buy New, Who Should Buy Rebuilt</a></li>
            <li><a href="#faq">Frequently asked questions</a></li>
          </ol>
        </nav>

        <div id="short-answer" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>The Short Answer</h2>
<p>
            <strong>A new Precor treadmill costs about $5,900 to $16,200, and a remanufactured one about $2,500
            to $4,800, on the prices sellers published on 27 November 2026.</strong> Precor does not publish
            prices itself, and it does not sell a new home treadmill; every new Precor on sale is a commercial
            TRM machine.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>New, TRM 500 line:</strong> $5,885 (TRM 531) and $9,845 (TRM 581) at Top Fitness, an
            authorized Precor distributor.</li>
            <li><strong>New, TRM 600 to 800 lines:</strong> $7,985 (TRM 631) to $16,230 (TRM 895 with the P94
            screen); a TRM 885 was $14,640 with the P82 console and $15,625 with the P84.</li>
            <li><strong>Remanufactured, one-year warranty:</strong> TRM 835 $2,495 (Build A Gym) to $3,999
            (Fitness Superstore); TRM 885 $3,799 to $4,799 by generation and console (Fitness Superstore).</li>
            <li><strong>Used, sold in working order:</strong> TRM 731 $1,645 and TRM 885 $3,575 at Global Fitness,
            with 30 days’ parts-only cover.</li>
            <li><strong>On top:</strong> $0 to $899 for delivery and installation, depending on seller and service,
            and possibly a dedicated 20-amp circuit; Precor specifies one for its TRM 600 to 800 lines.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            For the brand itself, its models and its service record, see our <a href="/precor-treadmills/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">Precor treadmill guide</a>; for every club brand’s prices, see <a href="/how-much-does-a-commercial-treadmill-cost/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">how much a commercial treadmill costs</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div id="price-table" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>Precor Treadmill Prices by Model</h2>
<p>
            Precor’s US treadmill page lists four belt lines, the TRM 800, 700, 600 and 500, plus a slat-belt
            model, and asks buyers to “Contact us” for a price. On 27 November 2026 we could read no price
            anywhere on precor.com. The page that used to be Precor’s home store, precorhomefitness.com, now
            redirects to Top Fitness, which describes itself there as “an authorized distributor of Precor”. Its
            store lists the whole current treadmill range with prices, so it is the best public guide to what a
            new Precor costs a home buyer.
          </p>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">New commercial models (Top Fitness, 27 Nov 2026)</h3>
          <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto my-8"><table class="min-w-[640px] w-full text-sm border-collapse">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Model</th>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Console</th>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Top Fitness price</th>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Line, per Precor</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TRM 531</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">P31 LED</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$5,885</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">500 line: 0.5–12 mph, 0–15% incline, 350 lb</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TRM 581</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">P84 touchscreen</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$9,845</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">500 line</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TRM 631</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">P31 LED</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$7,985</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">600 line: 3 HP AC, 0.5–12 mph, 0–15%, 400 lb</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TRM 661</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">P62</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$9,820</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">600 line</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TRM 681</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">P82 / P84</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$10,615 / $11,800</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">600 line</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TRM 691</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">P94</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$12,245</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">600 line</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TRM 731</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">P31 LED</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$9,915</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">700 line: 4 HP AC, 0.5–14 mph, 0–15%, 400 lb</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TRM 761</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">P62</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$12,065</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">700 line</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TRM 781</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">P82 / P84</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$12,800 / $13,680</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">700 line</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TRM 791</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">P94</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$14,290</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">700 line</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TRM 835</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">P31 LED</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$11,860</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">800 line: 4 HP AC, 0.5–16 mph, −3 to 15%, 400 lb</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TRM 865</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">P62</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$13,945</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">800 line</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TRM 885</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">P82 / P84</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$14,640 / $15,625</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">800 line</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TRM 895</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">P94</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$16,230</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">800 line</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table></div>
          <p>
            Prices are Top Fitness’s listed prices on 27 November 2026, with no sale or compare-at price shown on
            any new Precor treadmill. Consoles are as Top Fitness’s titles and product descriptions name them. Line specifications are from Precor’s 2025
            brochures as recorded in our Precor guide on 20 October 2026. One conflict: Top Fitness’s TRM 885
            (P84) page gives 0.5 to 14 mph and a 350 lb user limit, where Precor’s brochure gives the 800 line
            16 mph and 400 lb. Check the specification sheet for the exact unit you are quoted.
          </p>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">What the step from one line to the next costs</h3>
          <p>
            With the same entry console, the P31, a new TRM 531 is $5,885, a TRM 631 $7,985, a TRM 731 $9,915 and
            a TRM 835 $11,860. Each step up buys something concrete in Precor’s figures: the 600 line adds a
            400 lb rating over the 500’s 350 lb, the 700 line a 4 HP motor and 14 mph, and the 800 line 16 mph and
            a 3% decline. Within a line, the console decides the rest. On the TRM 885, the P84 touchscreen adds
            $985 over the P82; the P94 on a TRM 895 adds another $605. Across the range, the console can move the
            price by as much as $4,370 within one line (TRM 835 to TRM 895).
          </p>
          <p>
            A state purchasing contract recorded in our Precor guide listed a TRM 731 at $7,545 before a
            public-sector discount. Top Fitness’s $9,915 is higher, so do not treat either figure as fixed: these
            are list prices, and a dealer quote for a home or a building’s gym can differ.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div id="home-models" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>Is There a New Precor Home Treadmill?</h2>
<p>
            No. Precor At Home, the store Precor’s website links for home buyers, listed 13 products on
            27 November 2026: Glutebuilder and FTS strength machines, racks, benches, a bike mat, the Ab-X and the
            StretchTrainer. None was a treadmill. Precor’s 2026 warranty summary still lists two home treadmill
            lines, the 200 Series and the 400 Series, but we found neither on sale new.
          </p>
          <p>
            What a home buyer can still buy new is a commercial TRM, sold into a home by a dealer, with Precor’s
            separate home warranty. That is why the cheapest new Precor we found was $5,885: the home-priced
            models that used to sit below the TRM range are no longer sold.
          </p>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Home models vs commercial models</h3>
          <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto my-8"><table class="min-w-[640px] w-full text-sm border-collapse">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Precor treadmill</th>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Sold new?</th>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Price seen, 27 Nov 2026</th>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Precor warranty (new)</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">200 Series home (Energy Series, e.g. TRM 211, 223, 243)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">No</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">No new listing found</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Lifetime frame, 5 yr motor and parts, 3 yr console, 1 yr labour</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">400 Series home (Precision Series, e.g. TRM 425, 445)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">No</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">No new listing found</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Lifetime frame, 10 yr motor and parts, 3 yr console, 1 yr labour</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Premium Series 9.31 (older home model)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">No</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$1,389.49 on an Amazon listing; condition not stated</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Not in the current summary</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TRM 500 line, sold into a home</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Yes, via dealers</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$5,885–$9,845 (Top Fitness)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Lifetime frame, 10 yr parts, 3 yr console, 1 yr labour</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TRM 600–800 lines, sold into a home</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Yes, via dealers</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$7,985–$16,230 (Top Fitness)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Lifetime frame, 10 yr parts, 3 yr console, 1 yr labour</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table></div>
          <p>
            The home-line warranties are from Precor’s “Limited Standard Warranty” summary and the commercial-into-home
            terms from Precor’s “Commercial Cardio Equipment Sold Into Residential (Home)” limited warranty, both
            linked from Precor’s US warranty page on 27 November 2026.
          </p>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">The Precor listings on Amazon</h3>
          <p>
            Amazon still carries old Precor product pages, and on 27 November 2026 several showed a live price: a
            TRM 835 with the P30 console at $2,778.29, a TRM 885 with the P80 console at $3,495.00, a TRM 731 at
            $2,895.00, a TRM 946i at $2,495.00 and a Premium Series 9.31 at $1,389.49. The P30 and P80 consoles
            and the 946i and 9.31 models are older generations, and none of these listings states whether the unit
            is new, refurbished or used. Their feature bullets repeat Precor’s original warranty (“Lifetime warranty
